  "id": "action-disorganization-syndrome",
  "term": "action disorganization syndrome",
  "definition": "Action disorganization syndrome is an impaired ability to carry out multi-step actions. It affects everyday activities by disrupting the sequencing and organization of action steps, especially in tasks that involve using objects or tools.",
